{"id":"n67804-1-13","stage":1,"title":"연휴 · 连休","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67804-1-13-1","ko":"이번 연휴는 뭘 하고 보냈니?","zh":"这个假期你都做了些什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"연휴는","meaning":"连休","explanation":"연휴：连休；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"연휴","audio":"/audio/381948faf6ba74167998.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67804","senseId":"1","lemma":"연휴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연휴는","audio":"/audio/6151267ecf1365e5e4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"보냈니?","meaning":"度过","explanation":"보내다：度过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"7","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보냈니","audio":"/audio/c239d107ccefd2d2e972.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"381948faf6ba7416","term":"연휴","zh":"连休","audio":"/audio/381948faf6ba74167998.mp3","entryId":"67804","definition":"休息两天以上；或指那样的假日。","pronunciation":["연휴"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"让时间流逝。","pronunciation":["보내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3794b4fb32c8a764f5f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67804-1-13-2","ko":"모처럼 쉬는 날이니까 그냥 집에서 푹 쉬었어.","zh":"难得有休息日，所以就在家好好休息了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모처럼","meaning":"特意，难得，好容易","explanation":"모처럼：特意，难得，好容易","readings":[{"term":"모처럼","audio":"/audio/c5e9364a3b55a5020afc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16147","senseId":"1","lemma":"모처럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모처럼","audio":"/audio/c5e9364a3b55a5020afc.mp3"}},{"text":"쉬는","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉬는","audio":"/audio/4c1deace5e4668870e43.mp3"}},{"text":"날이니까","meaning":"日子","explanation":"날：日子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"4","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날이니까","audio":"/audio/d8dccad877c94a35578e.mp3"}},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서","audio":"/audio/c00afeb6cadab90f0098.mp3"}},{"text":"푹","meaning":"睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","explanation":"푹：睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","readings":[{"term":"푹","audio":"/audio/0080f27d41b51df36d72.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83605","senseId":"1","lemma":"푹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"푹","audio":"/audio/0080f27d41b51df36d72.mp3"}},{"text":"쉬었어.","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉬었어","audio":"/audio/a140f68260bcc1c7ff9d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c5e9364a3b55a502","term":"모처럼","zh":"特意，难得，好容易","audio":"/audio/c5e9364a3b55a5020afc.mp3","entryId":"16147","definition":"打算很久后才第一次实现，好不容易。","pronunciation":["모처럼"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"日子","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"以某种理由指定下来的一天。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"0080f27d41b51df3","term":"푹","zh":"睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","audio":"/audio/0080f27d41b51df36d72.mp3","entryId":"83605","definition":"睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","pronunciation":["푹"]}],"audio":"/audio/f4c2b420383f5dad92ac.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.627,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67804","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.2804,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["难得有休息日，所以就在家好好休息了。","我姐姐终于怀孕了。","这个假期你都做了些什么？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["难得有休息日，所以就在家好好休息了。","这个假期你都做了些什么？","我姐姐终于怀孕了。"],"answer":0}]}
